rue] [17592186432496 1075 #edb/ref 17592186432477 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432496 1075 #edb/ref 17592186432491 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432496 1075 #edb/ref 17592186432493 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432496 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432496 1077 "selection" 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432496 1078 #edb/ref 17592186432493 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432496 1079 #uuid "7ba0e4d8-f543-552a-b200-356460576b1a" 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432497 1075 #edb/ref 17592186432476 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432497 1075 #edb/ref 17592186432479 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432497 1075 #edb/ref 17592186432483 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432497 1075 #edb/ref 17592186432485 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432497 1075 #edb/ref 17592186432489 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432497 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432497 1077 "selection" 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432497 1078 #edb/ref 17592186432476 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432497 1079 #uuid "83cc079b-0440-5af9-a279-b83e4c99c769" 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432498 1068 #edb/ref 17592186432496 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432498 1069 "q-80822" 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432498 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432498 1071 "Let $B=\\{{b}_{1},{b}_{2},{b}_{3}\\}$ be a basis of ${R}^{3}$ and $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 10 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}].$ What are the coordinates of $x$ relative to the basis $C=\\{{c}_{1},{c}_{2},{c}_{3}\\},$ where ${c}_{1}=-7{b}_{3}$, ${c}_{2}=2{b}_{2}$ and ${c}_{3}=-{b}_{1}?$" 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432498 1072 #uuid "0b15402b-e686-556b-80b9-873d877b7aa1" 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432498 1074 "Since $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 10 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}]$, we can write $x$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={b}_{1}+10{b}_{2}-7{b}_{3} \\\\  & =-7{b}_{3}+10{b}_{2}+{b}_{1} \\\\  & =-7{b}_{3}+5(2{b}_{2})-(-{b}_{1}) \\\\  & ={c}_{1}+5{c}_{2}-{c}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $[x]_{C}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432499 1068 #edb/ref 17592186432494 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432499 1069 "q-113070" 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432499 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432499 1071 "Let $B=\\{{b}_{1},{b}_{2}\\}$ be a basis of ${R}^{2}$ and $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].$ What are the coordinates of $x$ relative to the basis $C=\\{{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\},$ where ${c}_{1}=2{b}_{1}+{b}_{2}$ and ${c}_{2}=-{b}_{1}?$" 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432499 1072 #uuid "1f3bd7e4-e9ee-5ec1-b495-697d442c712e" 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432499 1074 "We are given that\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{c}_{1}=2{b}_{1}+{b}_{2} \\\\ {c}_{2}=-{b}_{1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFirst, we express the $b$'s in terms of $c$'s. From the second equation, we get \n\n$$\n{b}_{1}=-{c}_{2}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n{c}_{1}=2(-{c}_{2})+{b}_{2}\\,⟹\\,{b}_{2}={c}_{1}+2{c}_{2}.\n$$\n\nSince $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$, we can write the vector $x$ as follows: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =-{b}_{1}+3{b}_{2} \\\\  & =-(-{c}_{2})+3({c}_{1}+2{c}_{2}) \\\\  & ={c}_{2}+3{c}_{1}+6{c}_{2} \\\\  & =7{c}_{2}+3{c}_{1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $[x]_{C}=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432500 1068 #edb/ref 17592186432495 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432500 1069 "q-34773" 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432500 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432500 1071 "Let $C=\\{{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\}$ be a basis of ${R}^{2}$ and $[x]_{C}=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}].$ What are the coordinates of $x$ relative to the basis $B=\\{{b}_{1},{b}_{2}\\},$ where ${b}_{1}=4{c}_{2}$ and ${b}_{2}=-2{c}_{1}?$" 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432500 1072 #uuid "2f3e71ae-af49-5472-af32-b57e5521039a" 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432500 1074 "Since $[x]_{C}=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}]$, we can write $x$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =-3{c}_{1}-5{c}_{2} \\\\  & =-5{c}_{2}-3{c}_{1} \\\\  & =-5({c}_{2})+3(-{c}_{1}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{5}{4}(4{c}_{2})+\\frac{3}{2}(-2{c}_{1}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{5}{4}{b}_{1}+\\frac{3}{2}{b}_{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{5}{4} \\\\ \\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432501 1068 #edb/ref 17592186432497 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432501 1069 "q-35261" 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432501 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432501 1071 "Let $B=\\{{b}_{1},{b}_{2}\\}$ be a basis of ${R}^{2}$ and $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].$ What are the coordinates of $x$ relative to the basis $C=\\{{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\},$ where ${c}_{1}=-8{b}_{2}$ and ${c}_{2}=3{b}_{1}?$" 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432501 1072 #uuid "5f9af9de-03ce-5718-9ed4-8f070e270c5e" 13194139534681 17592186045417 true] [17592186432501 1074 "Since $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]$, we can write $x$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =6{b}_{1}+4{b}_{2} \\\\  & =4{b}_{2}+6{b}_{1} \\\\  & =-(-4{b}_{2})+2(3{b}_{1}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}(-8{b}_{2})+2(3{b}_{1}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}{c}_{1}+2{c}_{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $[x]_{C}=[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].$" 13194139534681 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-06929580-b4ba-